#: auth_hooks.py:19 templates/eos_tax/base.html:5
#: templates/eos_tax/base.html:60
msgid "Alliance PvE Tax"
msgstr "Alliance PvE Tax"

#: forms.py:76 forms.py:256
msgid "Base tax rate (%)"
msgstr "基础税率 (%)"

#: forms.py:130
msgid ""
"Corporations of the taxed alliances. Excluding any other corporation would "
"change nothing."
msgstr "被征税 Alliance 的 Corporation。排除任何其他 Corporation 都不会有任何变化。"

#: forms.py:137
msgid "Base rate, used for months before the first scheduled change below."
msgstr "基础税率，用于下方第一次计划变更之前的月份。"

#: forms.py:158
msgid ""
"Has to stay at or below the longest break a run can survive, otherwise that "
"ceiling never applies."
msgstr "必须不超过连续段能容忍的最长中断，否则该上限永远不会生效。"

#: forms.py:229 forms.py:264
msgid "Rate (%)"
msgstr "税率 (%)"

#: models.py:49
msgid "Taxed alliances"
msgstr "被征税的 Alliance"

#: models.py:50
msgid "Corporations of these alliances are taxed."
msgstr "这些 Alliance 的 Corporation 需要缴税。"

#: models.py:58
msgid "Holding corporation"
msgstr "Holding Corporation"

#: models.py:59
msgid "The single corporation that receives the tax payments."
msgstr "接收税款的唯一 Corporation。"

#: models.py:65
msgid "Excluded corporations"
msgstr "排除的 Corporation"

#: models.py:66
msgid "Never taxed and never listed, even inside a taxed alliance."
msgstr "永不征税、永不列出，即使位于被征税的 Alliance 中。"

#: models.py:69 models.py:375
msgid "Alliance tax rate"
msgstr "Alliance 税率"

#: models.py:74
msgid "Share of the gross PvE income a corporation owes. 0.1 means 10 percent."
msgstr "Corporation 应缴纳的 PvE 总收入份额。0.1 表示百分之十。"

#: models.py:77
msgid "Taxed journal types"
msgstr "征税的流水类型"

#: models.py:80
msgid ""
"Wallet journal ref_types counted as PvE income, for example bounty_prizes."
msgstr "计为 PvE 收入的 wallet 流水 ref_type，例如 bounty_prizes。"

#: models.py:85
msgid ""
"Match payments by their reason code instead of by amount alone. With it every"
" payment carrying the code counts, so a corporation can pay in parts, and "
"paying more than it owes is recorded. Without it a payment is recognised by "
"its exact amount only, so two corporations owing the same sum, or one "
"corporation owing the same sum twice, cannot be told apart."
msgstr ""
"按 Reason 代码而不仅按金额匹配付款。启用后，每笔带有该代码的付款都会计入，因此 Corporation "
"可以分批付款，多付的金额也会被记录。未启用时，只能按精确金额识别付款，因此两个应付相同金额的 Corporation，或一个 Corporation "
"两次应付相同金额，将无法区分。"

#: models.py:94
msgid "Income that needs a wallet audit (million ISK)"
msgstr "需要 wallet 审计的收入（百万 ISK）"

#: models.py:98
msgid ""
"A character whose bounties reach the corporation wallet but not through a "
"member wallet is listed on the overview once this much gross income a month "
"is backed out of the corporation's slice. Without the member wallet a stretch"
" without ingame tax cannot be seen for that character."
msgstr ""
"如果某个 Character 的 bounty 进入了 Corporation wallet，但没有经过成员 wallet，那么一旦从 "
"Corporation 的份额反推出的月度总收入达到此数值，就会在概览中列出该 Character。没有成员 wallet，就无法看出该 "
"Character 在某段时间内是否没有游戏内税。"

#: models.py:106
msgid "Smallest payment difference worth flagging (million ISK)"
msgstr "值得标记的最小付款差额（百万 ISK）"

#: models.py:110
msgid ""
"A payment at least this much above or below the amount owed gets a badge next"
" to the amount paid on the overview; a smaller difference is shown without "
"one. 0 flags every difference."
msgstr "付款比应付金额多或少至少此数值时，概览中实付金额旁会显示标记；较小的差额不显示标记。0 表示标记所有差额。"

#: models.py:116
msgid "Smallest move worth listing"
msgstr "值得列出的最小变动"

#: models.py:123
msgid ""
"In percentage points of the share of the bounty that reaches the corporation."
" A move smaller than this is not listed, and days within it count as one "
"level. Nine percent to ten is one point."
msgstr ""
"以进入 Corporation 的 bounty "
"份额的百分点计。小于此值的变动不会列出，处于此范围内的天数视为同一水平。从百分之九到百分之十为一个百分点。"

#: models.py:131
msgid "Days without a login"
msgstr "未登录天数"

#: models.py:135
msgid ""
"A character once shown on one of the four bots lists is listed under Possibly"
" banned when its last login is at least this many days ago."
msgstr "曾出现在四个机器人列表之一中的 Character，若最后一次登录距今至少这么多天，就会列在“可能已被封禁”下。"

#: models.py:141
msgid "Shortest run listed"
msgstr "列出的最短连续段"

#: models.py:145
msgid ""
"How many payouts in a row a character has to collect without a break before "
"the run is listed. The game pays a ratter about every twenty minutes, so "
"eighteen is roughly six hours."
msgstr "Character 必须不间断地连续领取多少次发放，该连续段才会被列出。游戏大约每二十分钟向刷怪玩家发放一次，因此十八次约为六小时。"

#: models.py:151
msgid "Interruptions allowed"
msgstr "允许的中断次数"

#: models.py:155
msgid ""
"How many breaks a run may contain and still count as one. A daily downtime "
"would otherwise cut every long night in two. Only a break under an hour can "
"be forgiven; a longer one always ends the run."
msgstr ""
"一个连续段最多可包含多少次中断仍算作一个。否则每日停机维护会把每个漫长的夜晚切成两段。只有不到一小时的中断可以被容忍；更长的中断总会结束连续段。"

#: models.py:162
msgid "Longest gap that still counts as the same tick"
msgstr "仍算作同一发放周期的最长间隔"

#: models.py:166
msgid ""
"In minutes. The game pays about every twenty minutes and the tick slips, so a"
" little more than twenty leaves room for that without calling an unbroken "
"stretch broken."
msgstr "以分钟计。游戏大约每二十分钟发放一次，且周期会有偏移，因此略多于二十分钟可以留出余量，不会把不间断的时段误判为中断。"

#: models.py:172
msgid "Longest break a run can survive"
msgstr "连续段能容忍的最长中断"

#: models.py:176
msgid ""
"In minutes. A break longer than this ends the run whatever the allowance "
"above says. Without a ceiling one allowance would weld a morning and an "
"evening into a single twelve hour run."
msgstr "以分钟计。超过此长度的中断会结束连续段，无论上方允许次数如何。如果没有上限，一次允许就可能把上午和晚上拼成一个十二小时的连续段。"

#: models.py:182
msgid "Length of the busy window"
msgstr "繁忙时段的长度"

#: models.py:186
msgid ""
"How many hours of the day count as the corporation's busy window. A character"
" spread evenly over the clock lands on this share of any window, which is the"
" floor the score measures down to."
msgstr ""
"一天中有多少小时算作 Corporation 的繁忙时段。一个在全天均匀分布的 Character 在任何时段中都会占到这一份额，这就是评分所衡量的下限。"

#: models.py:192 models.py:266
msgid "Smallest character worth reading"
msgstr "值得判读的最小 Character"

#: models.py:196
msgid ""
"Below this many payouts in the month a character has too little of a day to "
"describe, and is left out of this reading."
msgstr "当月发放次数低于此值的 Character，其一天的数据太少，无法描述，不参与此项判读。"

#: models.py:201 models.py:275
msgid "Smallest usable yardstick"
msgstr "最小可用参照基准"

#: models.py:205
msgid ""
"How many payouts have to be left in the corporation once the character's own "
"are taken out. Below this there is no rhythm to compare against, only noise, "
"and the character is not scored."
msgstr ""
"去掉该 Character 自己的发放后，Corporation 中至少还要剩下多少次发放。低于此值就没有可比较的节奏，只有噪声，该 Character "
"不会被评分。"

#: models.py:211 models.py:245
msgid "Leave flagged characters out of the yardstick"
msgstr "将已标记的 Character 排除在参照基准之外"

#: models.py:214
msgid ""
"A character flat enough to be listed is also part of their corporation's day,"
" and drags it flat with them - which makes everybody else look ordinary. With"
" this on the reading runs twice: once to find them, once with them taken out."
" A corporation that would fall below the floor above keeps the plain figure."
msgstr ""
"分布平坦到足以被列出的 Character 也是其 Corporation "
"一天的一部分，会把整体一起拉平——这会让其他人看起来都很普通。启用后，判读会运行两次：一次找出他们，一次把他们排除在外。会因此低于上方下限的 "
"Corporation 保留原始数值。"

#: models.py:223
msgid "Smallest difference listed"
msgstr "列出的最小差异"

#: models.py:227
msgid ""
"In percentage points. How much flatter than the rest of their corporation a "
"character has to be before the list mentions them. A negative difference "
"means more concentrated than the corporation, which is the opposite of what "
"this looks for, so those are never listed whatever this says."
msgstr ""
"以百分点计。Character 必须比其 Corporation 的其他成员平坦多少，列表才会提到他们。负差异表示比 Corporation "
"更集中，这与所要寻找的相反，因此无论此处如何设置都不会列出。"

#: models.py:235
msgid "Distance counted as a full deviation"
msgstr "视为完全偏离的距离"

#: models.py:239
msgid ""
"In hours. Twelve is as far apart as two times of day can be, so the default "
"treats the whole clock as the scale. A smaller value makes the colouring "
"reach red sooner."
msgstr "以小时计。十二小时是一天中两个时刻能相隔的最远距离，因此默认值把整个时钟作为刻度。较小的值会让颜色更早变红。"

#: models.py:248
msgid ""
"The same for this reading: a character far enough from their corporation to "
"be listed also pulls the corporation's own middle of the day towards "
"themselves, which shortens everybody else's distance."
msgstr ""
"此项判读同理：离其 Corporation 足够远而被列出的 Character，也会把 Corporation "
"自身一天的中心拉向自己，从而缩短其他所有人的距离。"

#: models.py:255
msgid "Smallest distance listed"
msgstr "列出的最小距离"

#: models.py:259
msgid ""
"In hours. How far from their corporation a character's day has to sit before "
"the list mentions them. A third of the scale above is where the colouring "
"stops calling a distance unremarkable, so a threshold under that lets green "
"rows into the list."
msgstr ""
"以小时计。Character 的一天与其 Corporation "
"相距多远，列表才会提到他们。上方刻度的三分之一是颜色不再把距离视为普通的位置，因此低于该值的阈值会让绿色行进入列表。"

#: models.py:270
msgid ""
"Below this many payouts in the month the middle of a character's day is "
"wherever the noise landed, so they are left out."
msgstr "当月发放次数低于此值时，Character 一天的中心只取决于噪声落在哪里，因此不参与判读。"

#: models.py:279
msgid ""
"How many payouts have to be left in the corporation once the character's own "
"are taken out, before its middle of the day is worth comparing against."
msgstr "去掉该 Character 自己的发放后，Corporation 中至少还要剩下多少次发放，其一天的中心才值得比较。"

#: models.py:285
msgid "Least concentrated day with a middle"
msgstr "有中心的一天的最低集中度"

#: models.py:289
msgid ""
"In percent. How closely the payouts have to gather around one time of day "
"before that day has a middle: 100 when all of them fall into one hour, 0 for "
"a day spread perfectly evenly. A day spread evenly over twelve hours comes "
"out at 64, over sixteen at 42, over twenty at 19. Below this - for the "
"character or the rest of their corporation - the middle would be wherever the"
" rounding put it, so the character is left out of this reading."
msgstr ""
"以百分比计。发放需要多紧密地聚集在一天中的某个时刻，这一天才有中心：全部落在同一小时内为 100，完全均匀分布为 0。均匀分布在十二小时内的一天为 "
"64，十六小时为 42，二十小时为 19。低于此值时——无论是 Character 还是其 Corporation "
"的其他成员——中心只取决于取整落在哪里，因此该 Character 不参与此项判读。"

#: models.py:299
msgid "Entries before an hour counts as active"
msgstr "一小时算作活跃所需的记录数"

#: models.py:303
msgid ""
"A single entry is noise - a stray bounty tick, one ESS payout. The game pays "
"about every twenty minutes, so an hour of uninterrupted play holds three; two"
" is deliberately tolerant, because play gets interrupted and a false negative"
" costs less than accusing a player."
msgstr ""
"单条记录只是噪声——一次零星的 bounty 发放，一次 ESS "
"发放。游戏大约每二十分钟发放一次，因此一小时不间断的游戏会有三条；设为二是有意放宽，因为游戏会被打断，而漏判的代价低于冤枉一名玩家。"

#: models.py:311
msgid "Hours in a day before it counts"
msgstr "一天算数所需的小时数"

#: models.py:315
msgid ""
"A day counts as suspicious when a character earned taxed income in more than "
"this many different hours of that day."
msgstr "如果 Character 在某一天中超过此数量的不同小时内获得了应税收入，这一天就算作可疑。"

#: models.py:320
msgid "Days in a month before a character is listed"
msgstr "Character 被列出前一个月内所需的天数"

#: models.py:324
msgid ""
"A character is listed once it reaches this many suspicious days within the "
"selected month."
msgstr "Character 在所选月份内达到此数量的可疑天数后即被列出。"

#: models.py:330
msgid "Tax configuration"
msgstr "税务配置"

#: models.py:370 templates/eos_tax/settings.html:111
msgid "Valid from"
msgstr "生效起始"

#: models.py:372
msgid "First month this rate applies to. Stored as the first of that month."
msgstr "此税率适用的第一个月。存储为该月的第一天。"

#: models.py:379
msgid "Share of the gross PvE income. 0.1 means 10 percent."
msgstr "PvE 总收入的份额。0.1 表示百分之十。"

#: models.py:384
msgid "Tax rate"
msgstr "税率"

#: models.py:385 templates/eos_tax/settings.html:88
msgid "Tax rate schedule"
msgstr "税率计划"

#: models.py:405
msgid "Corporation ID"
msgstr "Corporation ID"

#: models.py:406
msgid "Taxed month"
msgstr "征税月份"

#: models.py:407
msgid "Taxed year"
msgstr "征税年份"

#: models.py:408
msgid "Corporation name"
msgstr "Corporation 名称"

#: models.py:409
msgid "Tax value"
msgstr "税值"

#: models.py:410
msgid "Tax percentage"
msgstr "税率百分比"

#: models.py:411 templates/eos_tax/index.html:33
#: templates/eos_tax/index.html:56 templates/eos_tax/index.html:183
msgid "Paid"
msgstr "已付"

#: models.py:428
msgid "Applied alliance tax rate"
msgstr "适用的 Alliance 税率"

#: models.py:431
msgid ""
"Alliance rate in effect when this row was calculated. Stored per row so "
"changing the rate does not rewrite what past months were owed."
msgstr "计算此行时生效的 Alliance 税率。按行存储，因此更改税率不会改写过去月份的应付金额。"

#: models.py:437
msgid "Amount to pay"
msgstr "应付金额"

#: models.py:440
msgid ""
"ISK owed to the alliance for this month, in whole ISK. Worked out from "
"tax_value, tax_percentage and alliance_tax_rate whenever the row is written, "
"and kept with them from then on - the page, the chart and the payment check "
"read it rather than redoing the arithmetic."
msgstr ""
"本月应付给 Alliance 的 ISK，以整 ISK 计。每次写入该行时根据 tax_value、tax_percentage 和 "
"alliance_tax_rate 计算得出，此后与它们一起保存——页面、图表和付款检查都读取此值，而不是重新计算。"

#: models.py:448
msgid "Amount paid"
msgstr "实付金额"

#: models.py:452
msgid ""
"ISK the payment check found for this month, in whole ISK: with reason codes "
"every payment carrying this row's code added up, without them the amount owed"
" once a payment of exactly that turned up. Empty until a payment was seen."
msgstr ""
"付款检查为本月找到的 ISK，以整 ISK 计：使用 Reason "
"代码时，为所有带有本行代码的付款之和；不使用时，一旦出现恰好等于应付金额的付款，即为应付金额。在发现付款之前为空。"

#: models.py:460 templates/eos_tax/settings.html:82
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "付款"

#: models.py:462
msgid "How many payments the amount paid is made of."
msgstr "实付金额由多少笔付款组成。"

#: models.py:466
msgid "Exact payment"
msgstr "精确付款"

#: models.py:469
msgid ""
"Whether one of the payments was exactly the amount owed, whatever the others "
"add up to. Set by the payment check along with the amount paid."
msgstr "是否有一笔付款恰好等于应付金额，无论其他付款加起来是多少。由付款检查与实付金额一起设置。"

#: models.py:476
msgid "Largest payments"
msgstr "最大的几笔付款"

#: models.py:480
msgid ""
"The largest of the payments the amount paid is made of, in whole ISK, highest"
" first - at most five. Set by the payment check along with the amount paid."
msgstr "构成实付金额的付款中最大的几笔，以整 ISK 计，从高到低——最多五笔。由付款检查与实付金额一起设置。"

#: models.py:487
msgid "Gross PvE income"
msgstr "PvE 总收入"

#: models.py:491
msgid ""
"Bounties earned this month before any corp tax, in whole ISK: the corporation"
" wallet reconciled with the member wallets, so a stretch without ingame tax "
"is counted as well. The amount to pay is worked out from it. Empty on rows "
"written before it was stored."
msgstr ""
"本月在扣除任何 Corporation 税之前获得的 bounty，以整 ISK 计：Corporation wallet 与成员 wallet "
"核对后的结果，因此没有游戏内税的时段也会被计入。应付金额据此计算。在开始存储之前写入的行中为空。"

#: models.py:499 templates/eos_tax/index.html:57
msgid "Characters without wallet audit"
msgstr "没有 wallet 审计的 Character"

#: models.py:503
msgid ""
"Characters whose bounties this month showed up in the corporation wallet "
"only, at or above the configured income, as [{id, name, gross}], highest "
"first."
msgstr ""
"本月 bounty 只出现在 Corporation wallet 中、且达到或超过配置收入的 Character，格式为 [{id, name, "
"gross}]，从高到低。"

#: models.py:510 templates/eos_tax/index.html:58
msgid "Calculation time"
msgstr "计算耗时"

#: models.py:514
msgid ""
"How long the last calculation of this month took, in seconds - reading both "
"journals, the reconciliation and the payment check. Empty on rows written "
"before it was stored."
msgstr "本月上次计算所花的时间，以秒计——读取两份流水、核对以及付款检查。在开始存储之前写入的行中为空。"

#: models.py:521
msgid "Payment date"
msgstr "付款日期"

#: models.py:525
msgid ""
"Journal date of the transfer that settled this month: the one of exactly the "
"amount owed, or the one that brought the payments up to it. Empty until a "
"payment settled the row."
msgstr "结清本月的那笔转账的流水日期：恰好等于应付金额的那笔，或使付款总额达到应付金额的那笔。在付款结清该行之前为空。"

#: models.py:532
msgid "Recorded as paid"
msgstr "记录为已付"

#: models.py:536
msgid ""
"When the payment check first marked this month as paid. Empty on rows marked "
"paid before it was stored."
msgstr "付款检查首次将本月标记为已付的时间。在开始存储之前就已标记为已付的行中为空。"

